# =============================================================================
# This repository tracks only the Java runtime + Builder source (CI scope).
# The RMXP game data next to it (Audio/, Graphics/, Data/, FF/, Fonts/, Save/,
# PBS/, project1/, __*staging/, ...) stays local: GitHub's 100 MB file / 1 GB
# repository limits reject it and scripts\ci-build.bat never reads it - every
# test works on the committed tests/fixture-project.
# =============================================================================
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/.github/
!.github/**
!/pokemon-builder/
!pokemon-builder/**

# Build outputs, caches and machine-local state inside pokemon-builder.
/pokemon-builder/dist/
/pokemon-builder/logs/
/pokemon-builder/generated/
/pokemon-builder/build/
/pokemon-builder/.probe/
/pokemon-builder/tools/ffmpeg/
/pokemon-builder/runtime/.gradle/
/pokemon-builder/runtime/**/build/
/pokemon-builder/runtime/local.properties
# Screenshot probes (:lwjgl3:captureMenu / captureMap) write ~3.5 MB of PNGs per
# run; they are regenerated, not source. Every directory directly under
# runtime/lwjgl3 is probe output (l1*, b1-*, ai-*, perf-*, accept-* ...), so all
# of them are ignored while the module source stays tracked.
/pokemon-builder/runtime/lwjgl3/*/
!/pokemon-builder/runtime/lwjgl3/src/
!/pokemon-builder/runtime/lwjgl3/pixel-diff.py
/pokemon-builder/**/node_modules/
/pokemon-builder/**/*.class
/pokemon-builder/**/*.apk
/pokemon-builder/**/*.zip
/pokemon-builder/**/*.tar
/pokemon-builder/**/*.log
